<view wx:if="{{target}}" class="sheet-backdrop"><view class="sheet"><view class="sheet-heading"><text>审阅商品预览范围</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="close" disabled="{{busy}}">返回会话</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="review-content"><text class="muted">原商品修订 {{target.revision}} · {{target.id}}</text><text selectable class="review-detail">销售国家 {{target.profile.targetMarket || '尚未提供'}} · 消费币种 {{target.profile.currency || '尚未提供'}}</text><text class="muted">逐项选择本次预览的准确内容。供货价、成本、起订量、建议价和生产期属于内部记录。</text><checkbox-group bindchange="select"><label wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="field" class="supplier-field"><checkbox value="{{item.field}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}"/><view><text>{{item.label}}</text><text selectable class="review-detail">{{item.content}}</text></view></label></checkbox-group><text class="muted review-note">本次只生成业务服务中的商品预览。图片来源/资料关联不代表允许外发；创建 Shopify 商品、发布到渠道和监测仍需各自权限及明确确认。</text><text wx:if="{{serverError || error}}" class="notice" role="alert">{{serverError || error}}</text></scroll-view><view class="review-actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !selected.length}}">确认本次预览范围</button></view></view></view>
